. See the Digital World and its intricately detailed realms like never before, with interactive elements and special quests to explore.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984270/extras/672d53cdbf5b32476a646786c6fdc840.poster.avif?t=1769036929\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984270/extras/672d53cdbf5b32476a646786c6fdc840.webm?t=1769036929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984270/extras/672d53cdbf5b32476a646786c6fdc840.mp4?t=1769036929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Strategic Turn-Based Battles<br>Enjoy dynamic turn-based combat that combines strategic elements with evolved battle components. More than 450 Digimon and deep customization options provide limitless ways to approach the challenges of battle and reveal the strength of the bonds formed with your Digimon.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984270/extras/55285906bf0d8182cd1e938ca26a7d78.poster.avif?t=1769036929\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984270/extras/55285906bf0d8182cd1e938ca26a7d78.webm?t=1769036929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1984270/extras/55285906bf0d8182cd1e938ca26a7d78.mp4?t=1769036929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Media.Vision Inc."],"dlc":[3524270,3524260,3524390,3524400,3524320,3524330,3524340,3524350,3524360,3524370,3524380,3524240],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-Tamper<br>5 different systems within a day machine activation limit","genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://share